- One or more empty lines end the current paragraph. Paragraphs in the result are separated by exactly two newline characters.
- Within a paragraph, ordinary adjacent nonempty lines are joined with one space.
- If the accumulated paragraph ends in `-`, remove that final hyphen and append the next nonempty line without a space.
